+## smallpt WebAssembly demo
+
+The home page embeds [smallpt](http://www.kevinbeason.com/smallpt/), Kevin Beason's
+99-line C++ path tracer, compiled to WebAssembly and run in a Web Worker
+(`src/components/SmallptDemo.tsx`, `public/smallpt/`). The source and build
+script live in `wasm/smallpt/`; the compiled `smallpt.js`/`smallpt.wasm` are
+checked in so no Emscripten toolchain is needed for a normal build. To rebuild
+them after changing the C++ (requires `em++` from the Emscripten SDK):
+
+```sh
+pnpm run build:wasm
+```
